WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.934
Now we move from organization to quality A dataset
can be perfectly

00:00:05.960 --> 00:00:12.204
structured and still be unsuitable for analysis
Quality is contextual

00:00:13.141 --> 00:00:17.233
Data that is acceptable for a monthly report may be
too stale for a real-time

00:00:17.259 --> 00:00:23.300
dashboard Quality is also evidence-based An unusual

00:00:23.327 --> 00:00:29.412
value should be investigated before we automatically
delete or replace it We

00:00:29.426 --> 00:00:33.439
will use six dimensions and a five-step workflow to
reason about quality
